title: "Who answers an input pasted into a Claude pane, issue 7676 A2+D"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Waiting
    lg1: Breaks CarriedRowEnds or NoSilentLoss or NoSilentLossObserved in some cases
    lg2: Path to the CarriedRowEnds or NoSilentLoss or NoSilentLossObserved bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 mayBreak
  class lg2 bugPath
  s0: Input waits for the owner (Claude idle)
  s1: Input waits for the owner (Claude busy)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a person starts a turn at the terminal
  s1 --> s0: the turn ends
  s0 --> s0: the owner's turn start meets an earlier turn's carried row and is refused
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 blue
  class s0 mayBreak
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
